uous operation, these tiny rounding errors accumulated into a 0.34-second drift, making the Scud’s tracked position over half a kilometer off. In which war was this catastrophic mistake made?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:52:35Z", "username": "Nikunj", "text": "Gulf", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:52:36Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Gulf", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:52:41Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "Gulf", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:52:44Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "Desert Storm", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:52:46Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "First Gulf war", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:53:14Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "First Gulf War in 1991 is correct", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:53:35Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Will give 10 to Nikunj and 2 to Nikhil for the complete answer ‎", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:53:54Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Scores: Arjun 10 Nikunj 20 Nikhil 2", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]